@@ -29,8 +29,8 @@ Three standard configs are present:
  * `rv64`: A configuration where only `MXLEN` is known to be 64, i.e., the RV64 ISA.
 
 The architecture is specified in a series of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YAML[YAML]
